      "title": "Models",
      "widgets_values": [
        "Install **Kandinsky6 SR** (`kandinsky6-sr`) through Manager and restart ComfyUI.\n\nClick **Download models** below (or use the **Kandinsky 6** menu). All SR weights and JSON configs are placed in the correct model folders; existing files are reused.\n\nChoose an input video and run. Select `2x` in the upscaler loader for 2x/2.25x; select `4x` for 4x. NABLA is off by default (`use_nabla=false`); enable it to use sparse attention with first-run kernel compilation.\n\nFor gated/private HF weights, run `hf auth login` on the ComfyUI server first."
